Value IPADDRESS (\d+.\d+.\d+.\d+)
Value MACADDRESS (\w+-\w+-\w+)
Value VLAN (\S+|\d+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value AGING (\d*)
Value TYPE (\S+)
Value VPNINSTANCE (\S+)

Start
  ^${IPADDRESS}\s+${MACADDRESS}\s+${VLAN}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${AGING}\s+${TYPE} -> Record
  ^${IPADDRESS}\s+${MACADDRESS}\s+${AGING}\s+${TYPE}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${VPNINSTANCE} -> Record
